    intro: "The tax collectors and sinners were drawing near to hear Jesus, and the Pharisees and scribes grumbled, 'This man receives sinners and eats with them.' In response, Jesus told three stories about things lost and found. They are among the best-loved stories in the world because they show the heart of God. Someone is missing, someone goes looking, and when the lost is found there is a celebration.",
