    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners what happened in the storm and with the Gerasene man and what these events show about Jesus.",
    mcq1: ["What did Jesus say to the sea in Mark 4:39?", ["Peace! Be still!", "Come to me", "Rise up", "Go back"], 0, "He rebuked the wind and said to the sea 'Peace! Be still!'"],
